{"assets":["/statement-assets/7bbb7a959c7304b2cac6d1ae85b41fe89bfd4948913c7ad6f58fafc253220394.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"833","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Ever-Hungry Krakozyabra"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/7bbb7a959c7304b2cac6d1ae85b41fe89bfd4948913c7ad6f58fafc253220394.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Recently, a wild Krakozyabra appeared at Jelly Castle. It is, truth to be said, always eager to have something for dinner."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Its favorite meal is natural numbers (typically served with honey sauce), or, to be more precise, the zeros in their corresponding decimal representations. As for other digits, Krakozyabra dislikes them; moreover, they often cause it indigestion! So, as a necessary precaution, Krakozyabra prefers to sort the digits of a number in non-descending order before proceeding to feast. Then, the leading zeros of the resulting number are eaten and the remaining part is discarded as an "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"inedible tail"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, if Krakozyabra is to have the number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"57040"},{"kind":"text","text":" for dinner, its "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"inedible tail"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" would be the number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"457"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Slastyona is not really fond of the idea of Krakozyabra living in her castle. Hovewer, her natural hospitality prevents her from leaving her guest without food. Slastyona has a range of natural numbers from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"L"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"R"},{"kind":"text","text":", which she is going to feed the guest with. Help her determine how many distinct "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"inedible tails"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" are going to be discarded by Krakozyabra by the end of the dinner."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first and only string, the numbers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"L"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"R"},{"kind":"text","text":" are given – the boundaries of the range "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ L ≤ R ≤ 1018)"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output the sole number – the answer for the problem."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1 10\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"9\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"40 57\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"17\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"157 165\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"9\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample case, the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"inedible tails"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" are the numbers from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"9"},{"kind":"text","text":". Note that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"10"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" have the same "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"inedible tail"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" – the number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second sample case, each number has a unique "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"inedible tail"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", except for the pair "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"45, 54"},{"kind":"text","text":". The answer to this sample case is going to be "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(57 - 40 + 1) - 1 = 17"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"833C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/833/problem/C"}